    - target: {fileID: 8801635912554541387, guid: b667376f51a7c8841b287be2eb51524a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: animator
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1693858171}
    - target: {fileID: 8801635912554541387, guid: b667376f51a7c8841b287be2eb51524a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.Array.size
      value: 8
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8801635912554541387, guid: b667376f51a7c8841b287be2eb51524a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.Array.data[0]'
      value: What's that? Flashcards?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8801635912554541387, guid: b667376f51a7c8841b287be2eb51524a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.Array.data[1]'
      value: If you need to review your flashcards, check your pause menu.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8801635912554541387, guid: b667376f51a7c8841b287be2eb51524a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.Array.data[2]'
      value: You never know when you'll need them.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8801635912554541387, guid: b667376f51a7c8841b287be2eb51524a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.Array.data[3]'
      value: Oh, and by the way. I've heard that you might randomly encounter someone
        here that works at the nearby data center.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8801635912554541387, guid: b667376f51a7c8841b287be2eb51524a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.Array.data[4]'
      value: The workers are somewhere along this pathway.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8801635912554541387, guid: b667376f51a7c8841b287be2eb51524a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.Array.data[5]'
      value: 'You should convince them the same way you talked to the Head Builder
        earlier. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8801635912554541387, guid: b667376f51a7c8841b287be2eb51524a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.Array.data[6]'
      value: Just try your best to get the words out of your head. Don't worry if
        you might fumble.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8801635912554541387, guid: b667376f51a7c8841b287be2eb51524a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.Array.data[7]'
      value: 'They say experience is the best teacher. Good luck! '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    m_RemovedComponents: []
    m_RemovedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedComponents: []
  m_SourcePrefab: {fileID: 100100000, guid: b667376f51a7c8841b287be2eb51524a, type: 3}
